  "title": "TotalEnergies proposes a dividend of 3.40€/share for fiscal year 2025, a 5.6% increase",
  "summary": "Paris, February 11th, 2026 – The Board of Directors met on February 10, 2026, and decided to propose at the Shareholders’ Meeting to be held on May 29, 2026, the dividend distribution of 3.40 €/share for fiscal year 2025, a 5.6% increase compared to the dividend for fiscal year 2024 of 3.22 €/share. The final dividend for fiscal year 2025 would be 0.85 €/share, identical […]",
